description: ShadcnUI component guidelines
globs: .tsx
alwaysApply: false
---


- Shadcnui as base for our design system.
- Critical: Shacnui components should always be installed in /packages/ui. 
- Consuming apps must import from @repo/ui, never from relative paths to packages/ui.
- When adding new components, update the Tailwind preset or tokens in packages/ui (not per app).
- Use mobile-first responsive design

## Component Patterns

```tsx
import { cn } from '@repo/utils'
import { cva } from 'class-variance-authority'

const buttonVariants = cva(
  'rounded-md font-medium transition-colors',
  {
    variants: {
      variant: {
        default: 'bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary/90',
        secondary: 'bg-secondary text-white hover:bg-secondary/90'
      }
    },
    defaultVariants: {
      variant: 'default'
    }
  }
)

function Button({ 
  className, 
  variant, 
  ...props 
}: ButtonProps) {
  return (
    <button 
      className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant }), className)}
      {...props}
    />
  )
}
``` 